{"metadata":{"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3],"title":[{"Plain":"“对偶复形”"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"对偶复形"},0]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>(Artan 讲的)\n$f\\colon X\\to Y$ 为"},{"Local":{"url":"局部Noether概形","text":"局部 Noether 概形"}},{"Plain":"之间的 "},{"Local":{"url":"Gorenstein态射","text":"Gorenstein 态射"}},{"Plain":", 局部有限型, 有限 Tor 维数, $f^!(\\mathcal O_Y)$ 同构于 $\\mathcal D(X)$ 中的某可逆层, 记之为 $\\omega_{X/Y}$. 它满足\n$$\r\nf^!(F)\\simeq Lf^*(F)\\otimes\\omega_{X/Y}.\r\n$$</p>\n<p>定义函子 $f^{\\#}(G)\\colon \\mathcal D(Y)\\to\\mathcal D(X)$,\n$$\r\nf^{\\#}(G):= LF^*(G)\\otimes\\omega_{X/Y}[n].\r\n$$\n它满足\n$$\r\nf^{\\#}(F\\otimes G)\\simeq f^{\\#}(F)\\otimes f^{\\#}(G),\r\n$$\n且对于光滑态射 $f\\colon X\\to Y$, $g\\colon Y\\to Z$,\n$$\r\n(gf)^{\\#}\\simeq f^{\\#}g^{\\#}.\r\n$$</p>\n"}]}}